# An action assigns /p, /p constrains a constructor, and that constructor assigns the implied /r. The /r guarantee reaches the caller on /p's parent particle, at /p::/r.
define the potential action<my.domain.com:my_lib:/test> {
    it also assigns the position</p>.
    define the position<run>.
    it happens when {
        the position<run> has a particle.
    } and it does {
        create a particle in position</p>.
        create a particle in position</p>::position</r>.
    }
}
